## @file
#  Beyond0LteFbSerialPortLib - SerialPortLib that renders the DEBUG log onto the
#  1080 x 2280 panel (notes/m8-uefi-image.md B54). Boot bring-up diagnostic:
#  nobody can read the UART on the S10e, so DEBUG output goes to the screen.
#  Switch back to Exynos9820SerialPortLib in Beyond0LtePkg.dsc to restore the UART.
##

